    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "文件描述符耗尽是压垮 PostgreSQL 的系统上限",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 一个连接一个后端进程，每个后端空闲时占十几个文件描述符，写入时可能到几百个，max_connections 设得过大又不做池化，很容易撞上 fs.file-max 或进程的 RLIMIT_NOFILE。征兆是日志里先出现 out of file descriptors，随后后端被信号 6 终止并触发崩溃恢复。作者的建议是用 PgBouncer 把连接收敛到几百个后端。",
      "url": "https://stormatics.tech/blogs/file-descriptors-the-os-limit-that-takes-down-postgresql",
      "author": "Warda Bibi",
      "source": "Stormatics",
      "source_date": "2026-06-04",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "运维",
        "连接池",
        "内核参数"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AWS 连载讲 PostgreSQL 扩展索引类型",
      "summary": "AWS 数据库博客连着发了两篇，梳理 Aurora PostgreSQL 和 RDS for PostgreSQL 上由扩展提供的索引类型：一篇讲 bloom、pg_trgm 和 pg_bigm，覆盖多列等值过滤、模糊匹配与日文等亚洲语言的检索；另一篇讲 SP-GiST、btree_gin 和 btree_gist，落点在操作符类和可扩展索引框架。这些能力在生产里常见却容易被忽略，适合拿来做索引设计评审。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/index-types-supported-in-amazon-aurora-postgresql-and-amazon-rds-for-postgresql-using-extensions-bloom-pg_trgm-and-pg_bigm/",
      "author": "AWS",
      "source": "AWS 数据库博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-03",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/06/02/DB3548p4.png",
